{"id":"poklonnik","lemma":"поклонник","pos":"noun","rank":2897,"glosses":["admirer","fan, groupie","worshipper"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/58/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"поклонника","plural":"поклонники","feminine":"поклонница"},"examples":[{"text":"Том - твой большой поклонник.","en":"Tom is a great admirer of yours.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"big, large, great"},null]},{"text":"Я знаю, кто твой тайный поклонник.","en":"I know who your secret admirer is.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"secret"},null]},{"text":"Я большая поклонница футбола.","en":"I'm a big football fan.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"big, large, great","l":"большой"},null,{"g":"football , soccer","l":"футбол"}]},{"text":"У тебя есть тайная поклонница.","en":"You have a secret admirer.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"secret","l":"тайный"},null]},{"text":"Я большой поклонник гольфа.","en":"I'm a big fan of golf.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"big, large, great"},null,{"g":"golf","l":"гольф"}]}]}